# A ranked Score chase run (endless, one life) to its results: one slab
# placed, then a slab that sails past ends the round (any drop near tick 49
# and then near 98 does). The run lands on this device's board, shown on the
# Leaderboards screen; signed out, nothing is posted to StarHermit.
until 300 Play
frames 5
click Play
until 60 Choose a mode
frames 5
save modes
click Score chase
until 60 Start
frames 5
save score-setup
click Start
frames 184
key Space 2
frames 47
key Space 2
until 200 Round over
expect a slab sailed past
expect Local board: rank #1 of 1.
frames 5
save score-results
click Modes
until 60 Choose a mode
frames 5
key Escape 2
until 60 Leaderboards
frames 5
click Leaderboards
until 60 Score chase — this device
expect You (Player
frames 5
save board
